#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:19 63afcba7607e4345b344acba2915ef49
msgid ""
"Due to flash memory limitations, this board does not include all ArduPilot "
"features. See :ref:`Firmware Limitations <common-limited_firmware>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"由于 Flash 内存限制，此飞控未包含所有 ArduPilot 功能。详情请参阅 :ref:`固件限制 <common-"
"limited_firmware>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:22 2e2ad6ecc0bd4a40bca2273b95af56a3
msgid ""
"some variants of these autopilots do not have a barometer. An external "
"barometer can be added, or operation with an alternate altitude sensor, such"
" as GPS for outdoor use or rangefinder for indoor applications is supported "
"(see :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>`), with the following caveats. In "
"Plane, if GPS is lost, then the user should switch to MANUAL mode "
"immediately to avoid a crash. In Copter, operation is allowed using GPS, but"
" not recommended, due to the imprecision in altitude hold modes. Bear in "
"mind if GPS fails and the vehicle is using it for altitude information, a "
"crash can eventually result due to lack of accurate altitude information.See"
" :ref:`common-gps-for-alt` for more information."
msgstr ""
"此系列飞控的某些变体没有气压计。可添加外部气压计，或使用替代高度传感器运行，例如室外使用 GPS 或室内使用测距仪（参见 "
":ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ<EK3_SRC1_POSZ>`），但需注意以下事项：在 Plane 模式下，如果 GPS 丢失，用户应立即切换到"
" MANUAL 模式以避免坠机。在 Copter 模式下，允许使用 GPS 运行，但不推荐，因为高度保持模式的精度较低。请注意，如果 GPS "
"丢失且飞行器使用其提供高度信息，最终可能因高度信息不准确而坠机。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-gps-for-alt`。"

