#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:116 25f0066c18b7451e83b49de848ef1fc3
msgid ""
"This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external "
"GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected as shown "
"below in order for autonomous modes to function."
msgstr ""
"此飞控不含 GPS 或罗盘，需如下图所示连接 :ref:`外部 GPS/罗盘 <common-positioning-landing-page>` "
"方可使用自主飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-matekf405.rst:122 51969f54cd6e4d42b89a7b881155be3a
msgid ""
"A battery must be plugged in for power to be provided to the 5V pins "
"supplying the GPS/compass modules. USB power is not provided to peripherals."
msgstr "必须插入电池，才能向为 GPS/罗盘模块供电的 5V 引脚提供电源。USB 供电不会向外设提供电力。"

